        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "My name is Kristy Edgar. I’m a paper artist."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’ve been making paper art for about eight years."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Since I was a kid, I’ve loved the "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Harry Potter"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "series",
            "ref": "v-series"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Back in 2017, I started making paper art pieces of the characters in this series. But I failed—the final pieces didn’t turn out the way I wanted them to."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The first movie in the series is "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《哈利·波特与魔法石》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It was released in 2001. The year 2021 was its 20th "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "anniversary",
            "ref": "v-anniversary"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". To honour it, I re-started my "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Harry Potter"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " project during that year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Of this project, the most difficult part was to show the magical elements. To "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "handle",
            "ref": "v-handle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this, I experimented a lot with different materials. For example, I used "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vellum",
            "zh": "牛皮纸"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "translucent",
            "zh": "半透明的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " parts. I brushed "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "nail polish",
            "zh": "指甲油"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on plastic to make things shiny. And I even tried my first 3D piece."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After all the hard work, I finally completed a series of 27 paper art pieces. In making it, both my creativity and skills have improved. I loved working on this magical project!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
